### SENSITIVE DATA ###
# Glob rather than a list of exact names: a future application-prod.yml (or any
# other profile) must not be committable just because nobody remembered to add
# it here. application.yml has no dash so it is unaffected; the two tracked
# files that DO match are un-ignored explicitly below.
.env
!.env.example
*.properties
application-*.yml
!application-test.yml
# Anchored: an unanchored `config/` would also match the Java package at
# src/main/java/.../config/, silently un-staging new classes added there.
/config/

# Compiled class file
*.class

# BlueJ files
*.ctxt

# Package Files #
*.jar
*.war
*.nar
*.ear
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.rar

# virtual machine crash logs, see http://www.java.com/en/download/help/error_hotspot.xml
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*

spring-client-*/
.aider*
